            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Improved microphone switching</strong> - Fixed an issue where switching audio input devices during recording could cause incorrect behavior or audio capture failures</li>
  <li><strong>More reliable device handling</strong> - Improved how the app handles audio device changes during meeting recordings, ensuring smoother transitions when devices are connected or disconnected</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
